//! # BitForge Mini Database Engine
//!
//! An in-memory Key-Value store backed by an Append-Only Write-Ahead Log (WAL) on disk.
//!
//! Features:
//! - Append-only Write-Ahead Log (WAL) with manual big-endian binary encoding (no external crates).
//! - Custom CRC32 checksum calculation to detect torn writes and bit rot.
//! - Crash-recovery replay engine with automatic detection and truncation of partial/corrupted writes.
//! - Thread-safe in-memory index (`HashMap`) protected via reader-writer locks.
//! - Online atomic background compaction (log rewriting with obsolete key collection).
//! - Custom TCP binary wire protocol supporting GET, SET, DELETE, COMPACT, STATS, and PING.
//! - Interactive REPL client, multi-threaded stress benchmark, and crash-recovery simulation suite.

